&lt;p&gt;test_45 failed with the following error:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt; FAIL: can't put import for osc.lustre-OST0000-osc-ff2342618b396000.ost_server_uuid into FULL state after 50 sec, have IDLE
client: import is not in FULL state after 50
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Test session details:&lt;br/&gt;
clients: &lt;a href="https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/127451" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/127451&lt;/a&gt; - 6.12.0-124.56.1.el10_1.x86_64&lt;br/&gt;
